57218508"}, "ownerUsername": "mama_mila_au", "ownerFullName": "Chantel Mila", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-16", "plays": 721148, "likes": 10068, "comments": 138}], "still_climbing": false, "is_relevant": true}, {"shortCode": "Db4pXC6SxM7", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db4pXC6SxM7/", "caption": "TYSM for 3M \ud83e\udd79 I started this channel in 2020 as a way to share simple and time saving ways to make your home look and feel amazing. It\u2019s such a joy to bring you daily tips, tricks and DIYs to help you transform your home into a beautiful space and I\u2019m so grateful to each and everyone one of you for following along \ud83c\udf3b as always, if you have any requests for future videos, let me know in the comments below! Here\u2019s a recap of some of your favourite tips from this year so far \ud83d\udc9b\n1. Prevent hard water marks on your taps by buffing in a thin layer of candle wax\n2. Clean your bins with peppermint oil to repel bugs and spiders\n3. If your clothes are covered in hair or fluff, throw a baby wipe into the wash to grab all the lint and hair \n4. Boil coffee, cinnamon and vanilla on your stovetop to make your home smell amazing before guests arrive\n5. And you can also place coffee anywhere you need odours removed \n6. A mix of 1 cup hydrogen peroxide and 20 drops clove oil is amazing at cutting through tough mould all around your home\n7. And wipe doors with lavender oil to keep bugs and spiders away \n\nHope these are helpful lovelies xx \n\n#hometips #homehacks #tipsandtricks #mamamilastips #homesweethome", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T03:42:28.000Z", "videoDuration": 29.951, "videoPlayCount": 210974, "videoViewCount": 83067, "likesCount": 3567, "commentsCount": 22, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/771814779_18103579835190993_6691154171886354192_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEl697PXt05aPXgMg3y-LWEB9TV8QYFGMBh1gokOgD6SEn