. Bananas: Wrap banana stems in foil to slow down ripening of your entire fruit bowl\n\nWhich one of your favourite? Hope these quick tips were helpful lovelies xx \n\n#fridgerestock #fridgeorganization #tipsandtricks #mamamilastips #homehacks", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T07:26:13.000Z", "videoDuration": 35.153, "videoPlayCount": 180648, "videoViewCount": 21195, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 10, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fktw4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/757524316_18102079460190993_4515998356091266161_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fktw4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEHR4Scpag_iQYqEoQjSS5UdfOq-Y4gYK_rIPOy_4EJVWn0xGwPUQxyfn31dO7OwDs&_nc_ohc=rMNOcxirxNYQ7kNvwG73Ap0&_nc_gid=0sgw-6WRh3ulatsPvCjk1w&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQHqQZfmNgADvr1nCLATsYwH_laT9kcqxF0CtqtIMMm_AQ&oe=6A878395&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fktw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMvmzMiyNwrPueLz47PjKW-rAbo2gWWa9wcJyQUyWlYZcjROsc648ZXZK8s8RZ1p-N8jS6hSg-UVVC2wf7K-W9YNR7V_oaA7EbXCgQ.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpSpd1T_PzEcoImnlTOdLWZUK5xwBJaj8r3_Z1c7W9rANveFzZYwtDZiqP9QqUCSF4&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fktw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Lqoy3lKEKVgQ7kNvwE11Pn5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTcyNzEyOTA1MTY2MjcyMSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjIwLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MzUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=40059dc7158e2f0f&_nc_&_nc_gid=0sgw-6WRh3ulatsPvCjk1w&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQE7dTPK-_H_5V3ZCZKtoOXwOp_pAtwqb94FTJfUnSIDHQ&oe=6A83717F", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "mama_mila_au", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "27986753934254737"}, "ownerUsername": "mama_mila_au", "ownerFullName": "Chantel Mila", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 162899, "likes": -1, "comments": 9}, {"date": "2026-08-09", "plays": 176733, "likes": -1, "comments": 10}, {"date": "2026-08-16", "plays": 180648, "likes": -1, "comments": 10}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "If your fruit and veggies seem to go bad the minute you buy them, here are nine storage hacks to help keep them fresher for longer. Store berries in a container lined with a paper towel that absorbs excess moisture, which helps slow mould growth. Wrap lettuce in a paper towel. Lettuce wilts because of moisture, so the paper towel helps keep it crisp. Store herbs in a bouquet of water to keep them hydrated and prevent them drying out. Store unripe avocados at room temperature and ripe avocados in the fridge. And this one's my favourite. Store an apple with your potatoes to prevent spouting. Submerge carrots in water to keep them crunchy. And store tomatoes upside down at room temperature. And wrap the stems of your bananas in foil to slow down ripening.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DbFzHjySc7y", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbFzHjySc7y/", "caption": "Which trick will you try first? Follow along for more daily home tips + let me know your requests in the comments xx \n\n#hometips #homehacks #cleaninghacks #cleaningtips", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T09:46:52.000Z", "videoDuration": 21.933, "videoPlayCount": 122372, "videoViewCount": 22458, "likesCount": 4442, "commentsCount": 7, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/753748014_18101573462190993_2947788658586313333_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gH3RA3TDevv_t38nK0B5aJVqNpOmVf9l1QZUa67srUjfkYq4ldeQBUiHNaxKifp4N0&_nc_ohc=UE7hRCE75RsQ7kNvwG1TfR-&_nc_gid=BacXbDqzWd6L6Uaylg6waQ&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQHuqRk0-NwrkXY8mxSHuHOBSG4ud632wHZEhL8kNJukTA&oe=6A8766FC&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQO5H74xkG02geLQ2WHKbr9lzNTPInW8_mEwrEbBxXO_OiHSTTuwKvxiUkle9Pwfy98zkAJUvVE4Q2hPOvoO34bdjyEGrxXbSdly